{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073480/extras/BorderSteam__2_.png?t=1743165451\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You awaken as a Doll in a desolate, crumbling city with no memories. The path to the Royal Palace lies ahead, but hostile automatons and arcane golems stand in your way. To reach your destination, you must face three powerful foes, each guarding a crucial place of your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073480/extras/Fight.gif?t=1743165451\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every encounter challenges you to maximize the use of your magic cards, artifacts, and skills. Choose your moves carefully, adapt to enemy patterns, and unleash powerful combos to vanquish each foe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073480/extras/Artifacts.gif?t=1743165451\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Before each run in Arcane Path, you\u2019ll choose one of the 12 artifacts that shape your gameplay. Each artifact grants unique status effects, enhances starting cards with powerful bonuses, and adds thematic cards to your deck. Artifacts also influence battle rewards, ensuring key victories provide cards aligned with the artifact\u2019s theme, which in turn offer new strategies and playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073480/extras/Book.gif?t=1743165451\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An ancient book whispers of forgotten powers tied to the 12 relics and the forces that set your quest in motion. Its cryptic pages reveal the marvels of a bygone era, hinting at a fateful ritual that left the city in ruins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073480/extras/ezgif-4-b31b0bd88a.gif?t=1743165451\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Claviger, the owl mask automaton, and her leader, Emerald Oracle, offer their aid on your path to the heart of the enchanted city.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073480/extras/EmeraldSteamBanner__4_.png?t=1743165451\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3073480?t=1743165451","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3073480?t=1743165451","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073480/dd8056c72f714d458821b1d844d42911777f85ff/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743165451","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073480/dd8056c72f714d458821b1d844d42911777f85ff/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743165451","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073480/extras/BorderSteam__2_.png?t=1743165451\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You awaken as a Doll in a desolate, crumbling city with no memories. The path to the Royal Palace lies ahead, but hostile automatons and arcane golems stand in your way. To reach your destination, you must face three powerful foes, each guarding a crucial place of your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073480/extras/Fight.gif?t=1743165451\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every encounter challenges you to maximize the use of your magic cards, artifacts, and skills. Choose your moves carefully, adapt to enemy patterns, and unleash powerful combos to vanquish each foe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073480/extras/Artifacts.gif?t=1743165451\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Before each run in Arcane Path, you\u2019ll choose one of the 12 artifacts that shape your gameplay. Each artifact grants unique status effects, enhances starting cards with powerful bonuses, and adds thematic cards to your deck. Artifacts also influence battle rewards, ensuring key victories provide cards aligned with the artifact\u2019s theme, which in turn offer new strategies and playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073480/extras/Book.gif?t=1743165451\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An ancient book whispers of forgotten powers tied to the 12 relics and the forces that set your quest in motion. Its cryptic pages reveal the marvels of a bygone era, hinting at a fateful ritual that left the city in ruins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073480/extras/ezgif-4-b31b0bd88a.gif?t=1743165451\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Claviger, the owl mask automaton, and her leader, Emerald Oracle, offer their aid on your path to the heart of the enchanted city.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073480/extras/EmeraldSteamBanner__4_.png?t=1743165451\" /></p>","developers":["stygian games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073480/header.jpg?t=1743165451","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><